<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <!-- Fonts & Icons -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #059669;
            --primary-dark: #047857;
            --accent-blue: #2563eb;
            --accent-gold: #d97706;
            --accent-purple: #7c3aed;
            --accent-rose: #e11d48;
            --accent-teal: #0d9488;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            color: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            /* Scenic Natural Indonesian Landscape with Pristine Emerald Morning Mist */
            background: 
                linear-gradient(180deg, 
                    rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72) 0%, 
                    rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.50) 40%, 
                    rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.65) 75%,
                    rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.90) 100%),
                radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25) 0%, transparent 50%),
                url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85') center/cover no-repeat fixed;
            background-color: #0f172a;
        }

        /* Subtle animated ambient glow */
        .ambient-glow {
            position: fixed;
            top: -20%;
            left: 20%;
            width: 60vw;
            height: 60vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15) 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 40%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(80px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            animation: floatGlow 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes floatGlow {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
            100% { transform: translate(-8%, 10%) scale(1.15); }
        }

        /* Top Header */
        header {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 20;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        .brand-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 4px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .brand-text h1 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .brand-text h1 span.badge-v2 {
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
        }

        .brand-text p {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        .live-clock {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }

        .user-action-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-portal-login {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
        }

        .btn-portal-login:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #047857);
        }

        .btn-portal-workspace {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .btn-portal-workspace:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Main Content Container */
        main {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1320px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Hero Header Section */
        .hero-banner {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
            max-width: 860px;
        }

        .hero-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
            color: #6ee7b7;
            padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -0.75px;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 400;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        /* Highlight Ribbon Tamu */
        .guest-cta-ribbon {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.85), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85));
            border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.35);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1.15rem 1.75rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            animation: pulseBorder 4s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes pulseBorder {
            0% { border-color: rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.3); }
            100% { border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.6); }
        }

        .guest-cta-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .guest-cta-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .guest-cta-text h3 {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
        }

        .guest-cta-text p {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .btn-guest-form {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #1d4ed8);
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .btn-guest-form:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e40af);
        }

        /* 6 Core Cards Grid (Launcher Tiles) */
        .tiles-grid {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.75rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1080px) {
            .tiles-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 680px) {
            .tiles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .hero-title { font-size: 1.85rem; }
            .guest-cta-ribbon { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
            .guest-cta-info { flex-direction: column; }
            header { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
            .live-clock { display: none; }
        }

        /* The Card */
        .tile-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            transition: all 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .tile-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.015);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
        }

        .tile-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .tile-icon-box {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.85rem;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tile-card:hover .tile-icon-box {
            transform: scale(1.08) rotate(3deg);
        }

        /* Specific Card Gradients */
        .icon-adm { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3); }
        .icon-keu { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.3); }
        .icon-pbb { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #f59e0b); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3); }
        .icon-ban { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e11d48, #f43f5e); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.3); }
        .icon-res { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #a855f7); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3); }
        .icon-web { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3); }

        .tile-role-badge {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #475569;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .tile-body h2 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .tile-body p {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.55;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .tile-features {
            list-style: none;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            border-top: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;
            padding-top: 1rem;
        }

        .tile-features li {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: #334155;
            margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .tile-features li i {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #10b981;
        }

        .tile-footer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }

        .tile-action-link {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: #0f172a;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .tile-card:hover .tile-action-link {
            color: #059669;
        }

        .tile-card:hover .tile-action-link i {
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .tile-action-link i {
            transition: transform 0.25s ease;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        }

        footer strong { color: #fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="ambient-glow"></div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <a href="/portal" class="brand-container">
            <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Logo Rohil" class="brand-logo" onerror="this.src='https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Lambang_Kabupaten_Rokan_Hilir.png/240px-Lambang_Kabupaten_Rokan_Hilir.png'">
            <div class="brand-text">
                <h1>SIAD 2.0 <span class="badge-v2">COMMAND HUB</span></h1>
                <p>Kepenghuluan <%= kepInfo.nama %>, Kec. <%= kepInfo.kecamatan %>, Kab. Rokan Hilir</p>
            </div>
        </a>

        <div class="header-actions">
            <div class="live-clock" id="liveClock">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock" style="color:#6ee7b7;"></i>
                <span id="clockText">Memuat waktu...</span>
            </div>

            <% if (user) { %>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="user-action-btn btn-portal-workspace">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i>
                    <span>Workspace: <%= user.nama_lengkap || user.username %></span>
                </a>
                <a href="/logout" class="user-action-btn" style="background:rgba(225,29,72,0.2); border:1px solid rgba(225,29,72,0.4); color:#fda4af;" title="Keluar">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i>
                </a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/login" class="user-action-btn btn-portal-login">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-to-bracket"></i>
                    <span>Masuk Petugas</span>
                </a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <!-- Hero Banner -->
        <div class="hero-banner">
            <div class="hero-tag">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                <span>Portal Layanan & Tata Kelola Digital Terpadu</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Pusat Kendali Administrasi Desa</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                Akses terpusat untuk Tata Naskah Dinas, Pengelolaan Keuangan & SPJ Siskeudes, Perpajakan PBB-P2, Bantuan Sosial, Resepsionis Tamu, dan Keterbukaan Informasi Publik Kepenghuluan.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Guest Book Quick CTA Ribbon -->
        <div class="guest-cta-ribbon">
            <div class="guest-cta-info">
                <div class="guest-cta-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-user"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="guest-cta-text">
                    <h3>Sedang Berkunjung ke Kantor Kepenghuluan <%= kepInfo.nama %>?</h3>
                    <p>Silakan isi Buku Tamu Digital secara mandiri tanpa harus antre di meja resepsionis.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:0.6rem; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <a href="/buku-tamu?desa=<%= kepInfo.id %>" class="btn-guest-form">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i>
                    <span>Isi Buku Tamu Digital</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/resepsionis/standing-qr" class="btn-guest-form" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);" title="Cetak Standing Meja">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode"></i>
                    <span>Standing QR</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6 Core Cards Grid -->
        <div class="tiles-grid">
            <!-- 1. Administrasi & Tata Usaha -->
            <a href="/surat" class="tile-card">
                <div>
                    <div class="tile-header">
                        <div class="tile-icon-box icon-adm">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-landmark"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="tile-role-badge">Kaur Umum & TU</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tile-body">
                        <h2>Administrasi & Umum</h2>
                        <p>Tata naskah dinas persuratan, buku agenda, lembar disposisi elektronik, serta inventarisasi aset desa.</p>
                        <ul class="tile-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Surat Masuk, Keluar & Disposisi</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Produk Hukum (Perdes & SK Penghulu)</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Inventaris Aset & Cetak QR Label</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tile-footer">
                    <span class="tile-action-link">Buka Modul Administrasi <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                    <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#64748b; font-weight:600;"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-closed"></i> Terpusat</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 2. Keuangan & SPJ Siskeudes -->
            <a href="/spj" class="tile-card">
                <div>
                    <div class="tile-header">
                        <div class="tile-icon-box icon-keu">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-money-bill-trend-up"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="tile-role-badge">Kaur Keuangan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tile-body">
                        <h2>Keuangan & SPJ</h2>
                        <p>Ekstraksi BKU Siskeudes otomatis, verifikasi SPJ berjenjang 4-tier, arsip Google Drive, dan buku kas pajak.</p>
                        <ul class="tile-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Import BKU Siskeudes Otomatis</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Cloud Drive V7 Auto-Hierarki</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Buku Kas Pembantu Pajak Belanja</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tile-footer">
                    <span class="tile-action-link">Buka Modul Keuangan <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                    <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#2563eb; font-weight:700;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check"></i> 4-Tier Valid</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 3. Perpajakan PBB-P2 -->
            <a href="/resepsionis" class="tile-card" onclick="alert('Modul Pengelolaan PBB-P2 sedang disinkronkan ke SK Petugas Pajak Kepenghuluan. Mengalihkan ke sistem...');">
                <div>
                    <div class="tile-header">
                        <div class="tile-icon-box icon-pbb">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="tile-role-badge">Pengelola PBB SK</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tile-body">
                        <h2>Perpajakan PBB-P2</h2>
                        <p>Pencatatan ketetapan pajak (DHKP), rekap setoran PBB per Dusun/RT, dan cetak tanda terima lunas warga.</p>
                        <ul class="tile-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Data DHKP & SPPT per Dusun</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Rekapitulasi Kolektor Pajak</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Cetak Tanda Terima Bukti Setor</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tile-footer">
                    <span class="tile-action-link">Buka Modul PBB <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                    <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#d97706; font-weight:700;"><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> Resmi Bapenda</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 4. Bantuan Sosial (Bansos) -->
            <a href="/resepsionis" class="tile-card" onclick="alert('Modul Bantuan Sosial (BLT-DD) siap dikonfigurasi untuk Kasi Kesejahteraan.');">
                <div>
                    <div class="tile-header">
                        <div class="tile-icon-box icon-ban">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="tile-role-badge">Kasi Kesejahteraan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tile-body">
